<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 22.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 22.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 22	Jan 21	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  256.690     252.790     247.020    3.91 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.230     303.150     306.830   -0.85 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.150     155.800     158.970   -1.77 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.314	46.174	47.182   -1.84 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  424.980     420.300     419.180    1.38 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.080     138.690     141.685   -1.84 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.093	16.033	16.185   -0.57 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.610     214.370     212.430    1.50 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.880	 1.864	 1.888   -0.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.572	 1.564	 1.581   -0.57 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  178.995     178.770     183.135   -2.26 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
